{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那我出门了」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我出门时向樱乃打了声招呼。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天也去爱理那里吗？」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0623", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……是」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正如樱乃所说……\\n不过被樱乃用这种淡淡的口吻说出来，\\n这句“今天也”总让人感到莫名其妙地害羞起来。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": "正如樱乃所说……不过被樱乃用这种淡淡的口吻说出来，这句“今天也”总让人感到莫名其妙地害羞起来。", "plain_idx": 193, "len": 51, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……樱乃也来吗？」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我又没有那么不识趣」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0624", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我去爱理家又不是只有调情而已……」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，能尽情享受二人世界确实挺让人开心的。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "不过，能尽情享受二人世界确实挺让人开心的。", "plain_idx": 198, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过现在，这段时间是留给做更应该做的事情的。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理今天也一定在努力吧。\\n我也要一起努力……", "text_idx": 200, "plain": "爱理今天也一定在努力吧。我也要一起努力……", "plain_idx": 201, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，新吾……咳咳，咳咳」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3038", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等会，你、你怎么了？！没事吧？！」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我匆忙赶到爱理跟前。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "来到爱理家后，我一眼就发现爱理的状态很差。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感冒了吗……？」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「或许是……等一下，咳咳，\\n　大概是因为我昨晚不知不觉间在被炉里睡着了吧……」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": "「或许是……等一下，咳咳，　大概是因为我昨晚不知不觉间在被炉里睡着了吧……」", "plain_idx": 211, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3039", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这又是为什么」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我一直在学习考试的内容，不知不觉间就……」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3040", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我仿佛能看到爱理累倒的样子。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟她白天也是，一直在过度地学习……", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咳，咳咳，咳咳」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3041", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之……今天先休息吧」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一边抚摸着咳嗽个不停的爱理的后背，\\n一边温柔地敦促着。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "我一边抚摸着咳嗽个不停的爱理的后背，一边温柔地敦促着。", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——爱理的身体就算是隔了一层衣服也很滚烫。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "——爱理的身体就算是隔了一层衣服也很滚烫。", "plain_idx": 223, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便如此。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我怎么可能做得到……\\n　明天开始，呼呼，就要考试了啊」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "「我怎么可能做得到……　明天开始，呼呼，就要考试了啊」", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3042", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理拒绝了我。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼哧……对了，我现在解题正解到一半，\\n　新吾你也，咳咳咳咳，快点坐下来吧……」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "「呼哧……对了，我现在解题正解到一半，　新吾你也，咳咳咳咳，快点坐下来吧……」", "plain_idx": 230, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3043", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来在我到这之前，爱理也一直在学习啊。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明身体状态都这么差了……", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啾！……唔～」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3044", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，好了，爱理」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3045", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你都已经硬撑了一个小时了吧……？\\n　好了，这时候也差不多该休息了吧」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "「你都已经硬撑了一个小时了吧……？　好了，这时候也差不多该休息了吧」", "plain_idx": 240, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你好烦，别打扰我学习」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3046", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈啾！」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3047", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——在这之后，\\n无论我说了多少次爱理都不愿意休息。", "text_idx": 245, "plain": "——在这之后，无论我说了多少次爱理都不愿意休息。", "plain_idx": 246, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还是在不顾一切地学习。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……唔唔……呼呼……」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3048", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊真的是……\\n　给我打起精神来，我的脑袋……」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": "「啊啊真的是……　给我打起精神来，我的脑袋……」", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3049", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有种爱理的身体在逐渐恶化的感觉。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的脸色都已经发白了，而且浑身摇摇晃晃的。", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "她的脸色都已经发白了，而且浑身摇摇晃晃的。", "plain_idx": 254, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理……」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要……」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3050", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么要这样」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为我必须拿到年级第一名啊！」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3051", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对不假思索加大音量的我，\\n爱理用更大的声音回答道。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "面对不假思索加大音量的我，爱理用更大的声音回答道。", "plain_idx": 262, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我咬着牙盯着爱理。", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾，你也听过，\\n　我跟妈妈说的话了吧……」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "「新吾，你也听过，　我跟妈妈说的话了吧……」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3052", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理也再次咬着牙看着我。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟她约好了，只有保持住成绩，\\n　咳咳……才能一个人住」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "「我跟她约好了，只有保持住成绩，　咳咳……才能一个人住」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3053", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算是，唔唔，得了一点小感冒……\\n　也不能忽视考试啊……！」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "「就算是，唔唔，得了一点小感冒……　也不能忽视考试啊……！」", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3054", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——那该说是爱理的自豪，还是她的偏执呢。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "——那该说是爱理的自豪，还是她的偏执呢。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我能深切地感受到她的执念。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜，呼呼……咳咳咳，唔～……唔～……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3055", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可是，爱理在我的眼前痛苦地呻吟着。\\n一边呻吟着一边动着自动铅笔。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "可是，爱理在我的眼前痛苦地呻吟着。一边呻吟着一边动着自动铅笔。", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「～～……」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "若是以前的我。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "绝对不会做出，\\n像这样违背别人的“意志”的事情的吧——", "text_idx": 282, "plain": "绝对不会做出，像这样违背别人的“意志”的事情的吧——", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……差不多得了，给我睡觉！！！」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我怒吼着。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——可是现在不一样。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "——可是现在不一样。", "plain_idx": 286, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我决不是看别人的脸色，我只是单纯地担心爱理，\\n所以我必须说出来……", "text_idx": 287, "plain": "我决不是看别人的脸色，我只是单纯地担心爱理，所以我必须说出来……", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "倒不如说，只有我才能说这种话。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，啊，诶，诶……新，吾……？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3057", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……该睡觉了」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3058", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什……什么啊，真是，这种事，我、我也知道啊……」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3059", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我就休息一会啊，就3小时，\\n　然后就起床……就3小时……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "「我就休息一会啊，就3小时，　然后就起床……就3小时……」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3060", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理虽然不情不愿，但还是钻进了被窝。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我轻轻地——点了点头。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "我轻轻地——点了点头。", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爱理的身体果然太差了，她不一会儿就睡着了。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……呼呼……嗯嗯……」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3061", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "三小时过去后，爱理仍然沉睡着。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3062", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在她的身旁，\\n用湿润的毛巾为她擦拭着汗水。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "我在她的身旁，用湿润的毛巾为她擦拭着汗水。", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，我没有打算叫她起床。\\n就这样让她睡着吧。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "当然，我没有打算叫她起床。就这样让她睡着吧。", "plain_idx": 309, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……唔，唔唔……」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3063", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明明睡着了都还这么难受，\\n　太固执了，太逞强了……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「明明睡着了都还这么难受，　太固执了，太逞强了……」", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "胸口好痛苦。\\n像是呼吸被堵住了的感觉。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": "胸口好痛苦。像是呼吸被堵住了的感觉。", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以前常常从爱理那里感受到的“痛苦”，\\n我……再一次感受到了。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": "以前常常从爱理那里感受到的“痛苦”，我……再一次感受到了。", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我就像是在热锅上的蚂蚁，\\n……有种动辄就要撑不住了的紧张感。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "我就像是在热锅上的蚂蚁，……有种动辄就要撑不住了的紧张感。", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈……哈啊，哈啊，呜呜……新，吾……」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3064", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我在……」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我温柔地抚摸着爱理的头发。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这名——名为濑名爱理的女孩子，\\n痛苦总是与她寸步不离。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": "这名——名为濑名爱理的女孩子，痛苦总是与她寸步不离。", "plain_idx": 325, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妈……妈……呜……呜啊，啊……」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3065", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——和校长在一起的时候，一直如影随形的紧张感。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "——和校长在一起的时候，一直如影随形的紧张感。", "plain_idx": 328, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想到这里，我坐立不安。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我拿出手机——", "text_idx": 330, "plain": "我拿出手机——", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『你好，这里是安洁』", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0569", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊安洁，突然之间打扰你很不好意思……\\n　安洁知道校长的联系方式吗？」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": "「啊安洁，突然之间打扰你很不好意思……　安洁知道校长的联系方式吗？」", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『啊，这个……我知道她的联系方式……』", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0570", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请告诉我。我想跟她打一通电话。\\n　……爱理她卧床不起了，就这样」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "「请告诉我。我想跟她打一通电话。　……爱理她卧床不起了，就这样」", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我来到外边，打通了电话。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——总之，我认为应该先把现状告诉那个人为好。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": "——总之，我认为应该先把现状告诉那个人为好。", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "据安洁说，\\n校长现在好像还在学校里。", "text_idx": 342, "plain": "据安洁说，校长现在好像还在学校里。", "plain_idx": 343, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我要重新拨电话回结女校，\\n让她接电话……", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "所以，我要重新拨电话回结女校，让她接电话……", "plain_idx": 345, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……喂你好，电话这头换人了』", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0229", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，您好，校长，我是瓜生。\\n　突然间打电话给您真不好意思」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "「啊，您好，校长，我是瓜生。　突然间打电话给您真不好意思」", "plain_idx": 350, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『有什么事情吗？』", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0230", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "电话那头的校长，开门见山地问道。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我愣了一下，\\n在脑海里选择了谨慎的话语再开口。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": "我愣了一下，在脑海里选择了谨慎的话语再开口。", "plain_idx": 355, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个……其实，\\n　我有事情想要对您说」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": "「这个……其实，　我有事情想要对您说」", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『小新吾有话对我说？是什么事』", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0231", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……爱理同学她卧床不起了」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『…………』", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0232", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，她是感冒了，\\n　您也不用太担心……」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": "「啊，她是感冒了，　您也不用太担心……」", "plain_idx": 364, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她只是有些太乱来，太勉强了」", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——当然了，现在在跟我通话的这个人正是爱理的保护者本人。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": "——当然了，现在在跟我通话的这个人正是爱理的保护者本人。", "plain_idx": 366, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "可我却想知道，在这种情况下她到底会有怎样的反应。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理同学，我感觉她有些较真，\\n　而且她还很在意校长您的事情」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": "「爱理同学，我感觉她有些较真，　而且她还很在意校长您的事情」", "plain_idx": 369, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——实在是应付不来。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": "——实在是应付不来。", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这两个人，究竟是为什么……", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「校长，那个」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……是爱理让你跟我打电话的吗？』", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0233", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长先发制人，静静地问着我。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不是，这是我自己的决定」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也只能这么回答。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『是吗……』", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0234", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『那么，接下来的事情你不用讲了』", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0235", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长平稳地，混杂着叹息说道。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "校长打断了我的话。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『不过，是你在帮我看护爱理是吧』", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0236", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "兰华", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……谢谢你。爱理她就拜托你了』", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "rk0237", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这句话说完后，通话结束了。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0625", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我回到房间，在我出去的这段时间里\\n代替我照看爱理的是樱乃，她抬起头来。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": "我回到房间，在我出去的这段时间里代替我照看爱理的是樱乃，她抬起头来。", "plain_idx": 393, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在跟安洁打电话之前我就先联系了樱乃，\\n让她过来帮我照看爱理。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "在跟安洁打电话之前我就先联系了樱乃，让她过来帮我照看爱理。", "plain_idx": 395, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「校长她说什么……？」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0626", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只说了爱理就拜托我了」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是吗」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0627", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理呢？」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还是老样子」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0628", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗……\\n　我今晚就在这过夜了，樱乃呢？」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": "「是吗……　我今晚就在这过夜了，樱乃呢？」", "plain_idx": 405, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一起」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0629", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……谢谢」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也坐到爱理的身旁。", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我的胸口还是郁闷着……", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——总之现在，先照看好爱理吧。", "text_idx": 411, "plain": "——总之现在，先照看好爱理吧。", "plain_idx": 411, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
